 "version": "0.1",
 "title": "TRIG pages",
 "category": "Framework",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "description": "More TRIG sub-pages, for generators: press TRIG again for 2/3, where knob A picks the track's generator (a mod that changes what its steps play) and B-H are its knobs, drawn as the stock pages draw theirs; once more for 3/3, the generator's view. The stock TRIG page stays 1/3. Each track's generator and knobs are kept on the +Drive. On its own (no generator) it adds only the GEN knob.",
